<!DOCTYPE suzuki [
<!ENTITY % sdatacharaents SYSTEM "..\config8\sdatacharaents.txt">
%sdatacharaents;
]>
<suzuki><manual>
<section sectnbr = "1K">
<servcat sctnbr = "01" scnbr = "11">
<configtype typenbr = "1">
<servinfotype sitcode = "6">
<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0C1B16002" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "01" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Catalytic Converter Removal and Installation
</title>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLSB0C1B16001">Exhaust System Components:K10C</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0C1B16002001" page = "2">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<attention4>
<ptxt>
Applying a shock to the catalytic converter may cause damage to the inside the catalyst.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Handle the catalytic converter carefully not to drop it or hit it against something.
</ptxt>
</attention4>
<s1 page = "2">
<ptxt>
Disconnect negative (–) cable at battery.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1 page = "2">
<ptxt>
Drain coolant. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C1616004"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove engine cover.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Release HO2S-1 and HO2S-2 wire harness from clamps (1).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFRA0B1B1002.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "63.743mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "164"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1 page = "2">
<ptxt>
Disconnect HO2S-1 (1) and HO2S-2 (2) connectors and then detach them from the bracket.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1 page = "2">
<ptxt>
Remove HO2S-1 and HO2S-2, if necessary. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C1316018"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove turbocharger water inlet hose (3) and turbocharger water outlet hose (4).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFRA0B1B1003.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "57.308mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "146"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove catalytic converter cover (1).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFRA0B1B1004.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "56.800mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "144"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove catalytic converter stiffener (1).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFRA0B1B1010.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "65.749mm" ver = "01" gw = "200" gh = "170"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove engine undercover.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove exhaust pipe nuts (1) from exhaust pipe.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove exhaust pipe stiffener bolts (2) from oil pan.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFRA0B1B1005.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "55.276mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "140"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1 page = "2">
<ptxt>
Remove catalytic converter (1) and its gasket from turbocharger.
</ptxt>
<figure page = "2">
<graphic graphicname = "IFRA0B1B1006.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "55.784mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "142"/>
</figure>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0C1B16002002" page = "2">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLSB0C1B16003">Catalytic Converter Inspection:K10C</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Reverse removal procedure noting the following points.
</ptxt>
<attention4>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
If the turbocharger is to be reused, check the threaded holes in the flange and the mating surface for rust which may cause loosening of the bolts and nuts.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
If rusted, remove the rust by grinding the surface and tapping the threaded holes.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Torx<sup>&#174;</sup> type stud bolt head could be damaged when tightening.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Carefully tighten the stud bolt.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention4>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Use new gaskets.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Use new bolts, stud bolts and nuts.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Tighten new stud bolt until incomplete thread reaches.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Install catalytic converter and its stiffener as follows.
</ptxt>
</item>
<list2 type = "ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Install catalytic converter (1) and its stiffener (2), and tighten new catalytic converter nuts (3) and stiffener nut (4) by hand.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Tighten catalytic converter nuts and stiffener nut with wrench until they are seated and then loosen the all nuts 90&#176;.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Tighten stiffener bolt (5) with wrench until it is seated.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Tighten new catalytic converter bolts (6) and nuts to specified torque.
</ptxt>
<torque>
<torqueitem id = "T1K101">
<t-part>
Catalytic converter bolt
</t-part>
<t-part1>
a
</t-part1>
<t-value1>
40
</t-value1>
<t-value2>
4.1
</t-value2>
<t-value3>
29.5
</t-value3>
</torqueitem>
<torqueitem id = "T1K102">
<t-part>
Catalytic converter nut
</t-part>
<t-part1>
b
</t-part1>
<t-value1>
40
</t-value1>
<t-value2>
4.1
</t-value2>
<t-value3>
29.5
</t-value3>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Tighten stiffener bolt securely.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
 Tighten stiffener nut to specified torque.
</ptxt>
<torque>
<torqueitem id = "T1K103">
<t-part>
Catalytic converter stiffener nut
</t-part>
<t-part1>
c
</t-part1>
<t-value1>
25
</t-value1>
<t-value2>
2.5
</t-value2>
<t-value3>
18.5
</t-value3>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IKSB0A1B1003.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "55.809mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "142"/>
</figure>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IKSB0A1B1004.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "65.752mm" ver = "01" gw = "200" gh = "170"/>
</figure>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Tighten exhaust pipe nuts (1) to specified torque.
</ptxt>
<torque>
<torqueitem id = "T1K104">
<t-part>
Exhaust pipe nut
</t-part>
<t-part1>
a
</t-part1>
<t-value1>
50
</t-value1>
<t-value2>
5.1
</t-value2>
<t-value3>
37.0
</t-value3>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Tighten exhaust pipe stiffener bolts (2) securely.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A1B1002.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "55.276mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "140"/>
</figure>
</item>
</list2>
<item>
<ptxt>
Install HO2S-1 and HO2S-2 if removed. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C1316018"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Clamp HO2S-1 and HO2S-2 lead wire. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C1316018"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Refill cooling system with coolant. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C1616005"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Check cooling system for leakage. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C1616003"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Run engine and check for exhaust gas leakage.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</servinfosub>
</servinfo>
</servinfotype>
</configtype>
</servcat>
</section></manual></suzuki>
